        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-wm-p7lxhnqwgwc",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Tropical islands"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:ec46e3209ab74818",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "282ac5afe99236398477684dbf46813dbfa278fb1d72cda0dcd58044ed2d3d4d",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-wm-p7lxhnqwgwc",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, you'll join a group tour with an English-speaking guide to Angra dos Reis or Ilha Grande.\n\nYour driver will pick you up from your hotel in the morning. A boat trip among the tropical islands is scheduled from 10:00 to 16:00. You'll spend the day among bays, green slopes and beaches best reached by water. After several city tours, it's a quiet break before your flight to Iguazu. After the tour, transfer back to your hotel in Rio."
    }
